# @CMD@ manifest — where each skill gets linked. One skill per line:
#
#   <scope>              <name>          <source-dir>
#
#   user                 code-review     ~/skills/code-review
#   project:~/Code/api   deploy          ~/skills/deploy
#
# scope        user            → every agent on this machine: ~/.claude/skills,
#                                ~/.codex/skills, ~/.agents/skills (those present)
#              project:<repo>  → <repo>/.claude/skills and <repo>/.codex/skills
# name         what the agent sees. Keep it equal to `name:` in the source
#              SKILL.md frontmatter — `@CMD@ doctor` checks that.
# source-dir   the one real copy of the skill; must hold SKILL.md. `~` expands.
#              No spaces in the path.
#
# Blank lines and `#` comments (whole-line or trailing) are ignored.
# After a hand edit:  @CMD@ sync      Both at once:  @CMD@ edit
